{"unit_id":"tag:041N:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。性质<MATH_0002>“<MATH_0003>是拟分离的（quasi-separated）”在<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）上是fpqc基底局部的（local on the base）。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的","context":"下降性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"性质对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041N:proof","translation":"拟分离（quasi-separated）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是拟分离的（quasi-separated），见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>。因而得到定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。设<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个态射（morphism）。假设每个基变换（base change）<MATH_0005>都是拟分离的（quasi-separated）。这意味着每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>都是拟紧的（quasi-compact）。fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）的基变换（base change）是fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），见《空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0003>，因此<MATH_0007>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering）。此外，每个<MATH_0008>都是态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>的基变换（base change）。因此，由引理<REF_0004>得出，<MATH_0010>是拟紧的（quasi-compact），即<MATH_0011>是拟分离的（quasi-separated）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧的"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧的"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离的"}],"unknown_terms":[{