{"unit_id":"tag:041O:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。性质<MATH_0002>“<MATH_0003>是普遍闭的（universally closed）”在<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）上是fpqc基底局部的（local on the base）。\n","allowed_english":["fpqc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭的"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭的","context":"下降性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"性质对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"local on the base","target_term":"基底局部的","context":"局部性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:041O:proof","translation":"将用引理<REF_0001>证明这一点。该引理的假设（1）和（2）由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>得出。设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的仿射概形（affine schemes）的一个满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个态射（morphism），并假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>是普遍闭的（universally closed）。需要证明<MATH_0005>是普遍闭的（universally closed）。为此，再次使用《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>，只需证明对每个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0006>及态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，映射（map）<MATH_0008>是闭的（closed）。考虑立方图（<REF_0004>）。<MATH_0009>普遍闭（universally closed）的假设蕴含<MATH_0010>是闭的（closed）。由于<MATH_0011>是拟紧（quasi-compact）、满射（surjective）且平坦（flat）的，作为<MATH_0012>的基变换（base change），映射（map）<MATH_0013>是商映射（submersive），见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0005>。此外，映射（map）<MATH_0014>是满射（surjective），见《空间的性质》引理<REF_0006>。由初等拓扑（topology）可得<MATH_0015>是闭的（closed）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭的"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭的"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭的"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"submersive","target_term":"商映射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_