{"unit_id":"tag:041R:proof","translation":"将用引理<REF_0001>证明这一点。该引理的假设（1）和（2）由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>得出。设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的一个平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），位于<MATH_0002>上；并设<MATH_0003>是从一个代数空间（algebraic space）到<MATH_0004>的态射（morphism）。假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0005>是普遍单射的（injective）。设<MATH_0006>是一个域（field），并设<MATH_0007>是两个态射（morphisms），使<MATH_0008>。由于<MATH_0009>是满射（surjective），存在一个域（field）扩张<MATH_0010>以及一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0011>，使下面的实线图（diagram）交换（commutes）：<MATH_0012>由于方块是笛卡尔的（cartesian），得到两条虚线箭头<MATH_0013>、<MATH_0014>，使图（diagram）交换（commute）。由于<MATH_0015>是普遍单射的（injective），得到<MATH_0016>。这迫使<MATH_0017>，因为<MATH_0018>是一个fpqc覆盖（fpqc covering），见《空间的性质》命题<REF_0003>。因此<MATH_0019>是普遍单射的（injective），如所欲证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射的"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔的"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射的"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc覆盖"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引章节，待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"测试映射对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"fla