{"unit_id":"tag:0CFX:proof","translation":"可以完全按照引理<REF_0001>的方法证明。另一种方法是使用以下事实：拓扑空间（topological spaces）的一个映射（map）是同胚（homeomorphism），当且仅当它是单射（injective）、满射（surjective）且开的（open）。因此，一个普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism）等同于一个满射（surjective）、普遍单射（injective）且普遍开（universally open）的态射（morphism）。见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>以及《空间的态射（Morphisms）》定义<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>、<REF_0006>。因此本引理由引理<REF_0007>、<REF_0008>和<REF_0009>得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"homeomorphism","target_term":"同胚"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"普遍开"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"底层拓扑对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"拓扑映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"homeomorphism","target_term":"同胚","context":"拓扑判据，待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射","context":"拓扑判据，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"拓扑及态射判据，待决。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开的","context":"拓扑判据，待决。"},{"source_term":"universal homeomorphism","target_term":"普遍同胚","context":"下降性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"普遍单射","context":"任意基变换后单射，待决。"},{"source_term":"universally open","target_term":"普遍开","context":"任意基变换后开，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下降性质的对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引章节，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
